<text format-version="0.2" work-id="w-nanqishu" book-id="b-nanqishu-027" chapter-id="c-nanqishu-027-wangkuan-xuanmo" source-id="s-nanqishu-027-wangkuan-xuanmo-ws1508012">
  <p id="c-nanqishu-027-wangkuan-xuanmo:p001" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter"><persName id="c-nanqishu-027-wangkuan-xuanmo:p001:m0000" ref="31b_fd1_f77_C">瞻</persName>兄<persName id="c-nanqishu-027-wangkuan-xuanmo:p001:m0002" ref="31b_fd1_f77_B">寬</persName>，宋世與<persName id="c-nanqishu-027-wangkuan-xuanmo:p001:m0007" ref="31b_fd1_f77_C">瞻</persName>竝為方伯，至是<persName id="c-nanqishu-027-wangkuan-xuanmo:p001:m0015" ref="31b_fd1_f77_C">瞻</persName>雖坐事，而<persName id="c-nanqishu-027-wangkuan-xuanmo:p001:m0021" ref="31b_fd1_f77_B">寬</persName>位待如舊也。<persName id="c-nanqishu-027-wangkuan-xuanmo:p001:m0028" ref="31b_fd1_f77_B">寬</persName>泰始初為隨郡，值西方反，父<persName id="c-nanqishu-027-wangkuan-xuanmo:p001:m0042" ref="31b_fd1_f77">玄謨</persName>在都，<persName id="c-nanqishu-027-wangkuan-xuanmo:p001:m0047" ref="31b_fd1_f77_B">寬</persName>棄郡歸，明帝加賞，使隨<persName id="c-nanqishu-027-wangkuan-xuanmo:p001:m0059" ref="d50_8f5_wul_AAAAE">張永</persName>討<persName id="c-nanqishu-027-wangkuan-xuanmo:p001:m0062" ref="u3k_51j_4ul_A">薛安都</persName>。<persName id="c-nanqishu-027-wangkuan-xuanmo:p001:m0066" ref="31b_fd1_f77_B">寬</persName>辭以<rs id="c-nanqishu-027-wangkuan-xuanmo:p001:u-mother" type="unresolved">母</rs>猶存，在西為賊所執，請得西行。遂襲破隨郡，斬偽太守<persName id="c-nanqishu-027-wangkuan-xuanmo:p001:m0095" ref="xbx_yfp_zsd">劉師念</persName>，拔其母。事平，明帝嘉之，使圖畫<persName id="c-nanqishu-027-wangkuan-xuanmo:p001:m0114" ref="31b_fd1_f77_B">寬</persName>形。建元初，為散騎常侍、光祿大夫，領前軍將軍。永明元年，為太常。坐於宅殺牛，免官。後為光祿大夫。三年，卒。</p>
</text>
